data: {"id": "bf4130cd0dff4322-thinking-parallel_evidence-2851", "run_id": "bf4130cd0dff4322", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，对 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 的 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 直接原因分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **Pod**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` (UID: `b1c01c93-0091-4506-bcbd-69cfd75e0f12`)\n*   **Namespace**: `aiops-case-10`\n*   **状态**: Phase 为 `Running`，但 `Ready` 为 `False`。Container `app` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 `35` 次，最后退出码 `Exit Code: 137`。\n*   **节点**: 调度在 `node2`。\n\n### 2. 证据采集事实 (支持/反驳)\n\n**事实 A：进程被 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137)**\n*   **来源**: `kubectl_describe` / `kubectl_get_yaml`\n*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788472343318, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

